From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] lmcache: opt-in full sliding-window chunks for plain store/retrieve

LMCACHE_FULL_SW_KV=1 (server, default 0 = unchanged) turns on the existing
full per-chunk sliding-window KV mode (enable_full_sw_kv, used by CacheBlend)
for plain store/retrieve: sliding-window groups store and restore every block
of a chunk instead of only the chunk's last sub-chunk window.

MiMo-V2.6-Flash (39 SWA-128 layers in 16-token blocks, 256-token chunks)
reloads wrong KV through the sub-chunk window path: after evicting a prompt
from the GPU prefix cache, every LMCache reload decoded garbage (3k and 8k
prompts, same engine and prefill -> decode), while with full SWA chunks every
reload answered correctly. The cost is the SWA groups' share of the stored
bytes doubling (16 instead of 8 blocks per chunk). Not combinable with
LMCACHE_MERGE_BOUNDED_PD (enable_full_sw_kv rejects it, as for CacheBlend).
---
diff --git a/lmcache/v1/multiprocess/server.py b/lmcache/v1/multiprocess/server.py
--- a/lmcache/v1/multiprocess/server.py
+++ b/lmcache/v1/multiprocess/server.py
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 
 # Standard
 import argparse
+import os
 import shutil
 import signal
 import sys
@@ -364,13 +365,20 @@
     # keep their one-block restore window, so a blend server also serves
     # stock hybrid clients.
     is_blend = mp_config.engine_type == "blend"
+    # LMCACHE_FULL_SW_KV=1 (default 0): the same full per-chunk SWA KV for
+    # plain store/retrieve. Needed by models whose sub-chunk sliding-window
+    # restore is not reproduced exactly (MiMo-V2.6: SWA-128 groups with
+    # 16-token blocks and 256-token chunks reload wrong KV without it).
+    full_sw_kv = is_blend or os.environ.get("LMCACHE_FULL_SW_KV", "0") == "1"
+    if full_sw_kv and not is_blend:
+        logger.info("LMCACHE_FULL_SW_KV=1: sliding-window groups store full chunks")
 
     ctx = MPCacheServerContext(
         storage_manager_config=storage_manager_config,
         chunk_size=mp_config.chunk_size,
         hash_algorithm=mp_config.hash_algorithm,
         separate_object_groups=mp_config.separate_object_groups,
-        full_sw_kv=is_blend,
+        full_sw_kv=full_sw_kv,
     )
 
     modules = _build_modules(ctx, mp_config, coordinator_config)
